### 7. 创建宁中则 (T1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "宁中则",
    "tier": 1,
    "faction": "华山派",
    "role": "师娘",
    "template": "师娘型",
    "x": 4,
    "y": 5,
    "location_name": "掌门卧房",
    "personality": "刚正不阿，侠骨柔肠，极度护短，对弟子视如己出",
    "core_motivation": "保护家人 = 维护正道 > 盲从丈夫",
    "initial_memory": "不群最近似乎压力很大，整天愁眉不展。冲儿这孩子虽然顽劣，但本性纯良，是个可造之材。",
    "health": 100,
    "inner_power": 70,
    "sword_skill": 75,
    "talent": 65,
    "wisdom": 60,
    "charisma": 60,
    "perception": 65,
    "luck": 55,
    "speed": 2.0
}

### 8. 查看所有角色
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents

### 8.1 查看单个角色 (替换 agent_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents/REPLACE_AGENT_ID

### 8.2 修改角色 (替换 agent_id)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents/ff2e49744971
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "x": 4,
    "y": 5
}

### 8.3 删除单个角色 (替换 agent_id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents/REPLACE_AGENT_ID

### 8.4 删除该世界所有角色 (MVP 专用)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents

### 9. 推进 1 个 tick
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick

### 10. 推进到卯时 (tick=3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick

### 11. 查看令狐冲的记忆 (替换 agent_id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents/REPLACE_AGENT_ID/memories

### 12. 推进到未时 (tick=7，反思触发)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick
###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/tick

### 13. 查看世界状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}

### 14. 查看令狐冲记忆 (应有反思记录 + 骰子结果)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{world_id}}/agents/REPLACE_AGENT_ID/memories
